1
00:00:03,177 --> 00:00:10,100
The platform administrator sees every parent on the Tenant Hierarchy screen, with its clients underneath.

2
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:14,590
A client whose parent no longer exists is an orphan, and is listed

3
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:17,147
apart, with Move and Make ordinary.

4
00:00:17,598 --> 00:00:24,318
Make ordinary turns the orphan into an ordinary tenant, which keeps its address and its data.

5
00:00:26,246 --> 00:00:29,757
On a parent's page, each client has a Move menu.

6
00:00:29,757 --> 00:00:32,423
Pick another parent and click Move.

7
00:00:32,423 --> 00:00:37,885
The client's address changes, every open session from the old parent ends, and

8
00:00:37,885 --> 00:00:40,096
the old parent is not asked.

9
00:00:41,226 --> 00:00:45,416
A parent that has no clients can be made an ordinary tenant again

10
00:00:45,416 --> 00:00:49,193
with Make ordinary, and it keeps its data and its address.

11
00:00:49,193 --> 00:00:53,206
A parent that still has clients cannot be removed by accident.

